# Konteks build image Warungku.
# Tanpa ini, `COPY . .` ikut membawa vendor/ dan node_modules/ dari host —
# vendor hasil build di satu mesin bisa tidak cocok dengan PHP di container.
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
.zed
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.live
vendor
node_modules
public/build
public/hot
storage/logs/*
storage/framework/cache/data/*
storage/framework/sessions/*
storage/framework/views/*
storage/framework/testing/*
database/*.sqlite
backups
*.md
!README.md
Dockerfile
compose*.yaml
Makefile
docker-compose*.yml
